<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 208)</h2>
<p><b>The watched folder now understands versions.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>A delivery named the way pipelines name them — <code>SH010_v003</code>, <code>sh010_comp_v12</code> — is recognised as a <b>version of a shot</b>.</li>
<li>When a new version lands, it appears <b>beside the versions already in your playlist</b>, grouped under the shot name.</li>
<li>The version it replaces joins the compare set automatically: on the new clip, <b>press 2</b> and you're wiping against the old one. "What changed?" is one keypress.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
